;fillColor=#0b6fbd;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;aspect=fixed;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1062" y="487" width="26" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b10" value="10" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0b6fbd;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;aspect=fixed;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1477" y="442" width="26" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b11" value="11" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0b6fbd;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;aspect=fixed;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1287" y="577" width="26" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b12" value="12" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0b6fbd;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;aspect=fixed;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="327" y="737" width="26" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b13" value="13" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0b6fbd;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;aspect=fixed;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="322" y="1057" width="26" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b14" value="14" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0b6fbd;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;aspect=fixed;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="762" y="1039" width="26" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b15" value="15" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0b6fbd;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;aspect=fixed;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="997" y="1059" width="26" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b16" value="16" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0b6fbd;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;aspect=fixed;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1202" y="1059" width="26" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b17" value="17" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0b6fbd;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;aspect=fixed;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1447" y="1039" width="26" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b18" value="18" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0b6fbd;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;aspect=fixed;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1642" y="1059" width="26" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend0" value="1  User reaches the site over HTTPS through AWS WAF and CloudFront.&lt;br&gt;2  CloudFront reads the static frontend from a private S3 bucket (origin access control).&lt;br&gt;3  User signs in with Cognito (authorization code + PKCE, required TOTP MFA).&lt;br&gt;4  Browser calls API Gateway; protected routes carry the Cognito JWT.&lt;br&gt;5  The API Gateway JWT authorizer validates the token; user ID comes only from verified claims.&lt;br&gt;6  API Gateway invokes the focused Lambda functions in the two private subnets.&lt;br&gt;7  prediction and history use DynamoDB (history and idempotency tables) over a gateway endpoint.&lt;br&gt;8  chat reads the caller's history and calls Bedrock Claude Haiku through an interface endpoint.&lt;br&gt;9  analytics runs approved Athena queries over the Parquet data lake in S3." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="230" y="1255" width="720" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend1" value="10 A Glue ETL job transforms raw CSV into processed Parquet in the S3 data lake.&lt;br&gt;11 Lambda logs go to CloudWatch Logs; alarms publish to an encrypted SNS topic, then email.&lt;br&gt;12 CloudTrail records regional management events to a protected S3 bucket.&lt;br&gt;13 Developer pushes to GitHub (main or pull request).&lt;br&gt;14 CI, security scans and CodeQL must pass.&lt;br&gt;15 Deploy is manual: type DEPLOY and the development environment approves.&lt;br&gt;16 GitHub assumes an IAM role through OIDC (short-lived credentials, no stored keys).&lt;br&gt;17 Terraform plans, then applies the reviewed plan; the immutable image goes to ECR.&lt;br&gt;18 After a successful deploy, an OWASP ZAP baseline scan runs against the site." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="970" y="1255" width="720" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>